Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi,

I do not think there is 'one' answer here. yes, AR processes are key to try,
like model="ar1" or model="ar",order=2, for 2nd order, or higher.

I guess you aim to try to add weekly additive time-effect, meaning that the
time-effect is constant for all locations. you can also try, if needed, a space
varying time-effect, where the time is AR1 or higher order, but the effect of
this depends on location. this will cost more computationally...

I think you just have to try and check how simple model you can get away with.

Best
H

